/target

# Build/log output `cargo mutants` writes locally (see CONTRIBUTING.md,
# "Mutation testing") — never committed, same treatment as fuzz/.gitignore's
# /artifacts for cargo-fuzz's local output.
/mutants.out
/mutants.out.old

# Per-user scratch notes — never committed. Use these names freely for
# throwaway planning/working files.
*.local.md
task_plan.md
findings.md
progress.md

# Contributor-agent instructions and internal design briefs — local to this
# checkout, never committed. Public conventions live in CONTRIBUTING.md.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/.claude/
/PROCESSKIT_CLI_DEVELOPMENT_BRIEF.md

# Agent-orchestration scratch tree (task queue, working state, logs) — local
# to this checkout, never committed.
/.work/

# Rust
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
